# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The household note panel. Text SLOTS come from outside the scene:
# `POST /api/text 0 Dinner at 7` (or a Home Assistant text entity) sets the
# crawling message, slot 1 the short "from" beside the envelope. Nothing in
# the scene is edited to change what it says.
S - Message Board
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Flow
I @pat/curl-flow-2d
R 60 0:000000 255:6a7bff
L color 0 19 0 11 normal 75 none fill 1
N Band
L sprite 1 2 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Icon
I @spr/envelope
L text 12 3 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N From
T slot 1
F tiny ffd166 l none 0
L text 0 21 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Message
T slot 0
F regular ffffff l left 20
